# Line endings for this repo. These rules override each person's own Git
# setting (core.autocrlf), so the repo behaves the same on Windows, macOS and Linux.

# Text files are stored with LF and checked out with LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files need CRLF line endings.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Specification documents and personal notes are kept byte-for-byte as written
# (no line-ending conversion), so Git never changes them.
spec_docs/** -text
Notes.txt -text

# Binary files: never convert or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
